      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "主题开关：方块纸面加一枚彩色点。",
      "html": "<button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-brand\" aria-label=\"当前为克制主题，点击切换到大胆主题\"><span class=\"ds-brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"ds-mark-dot\"></span></span><span class=\"ds-wordmark\">目录</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.85rem;border:0;background:transparent;cursor:pointer;color:#121212;font-family:\"Source Serif 4\",serif}.ds-brand-mark{position:relative;width:2.35rem;height:2.35rem;background:#fff;border:1px solid #121212;border-radius:8px}.ds-mark-dot{position:absolute;right:0.28rem;bottom:0.28rem;width:0.72rem;height:0.72rem;background:#d97757;border-radius:2px}.ds-wordmark{font-size:1.85rem;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.02em}.ds-brand:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #121212;outline-offset:3px}"
